{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも読んでくださってる方、\n初めて読んでくださった方、\nコメントしてくださった方、\nありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学園祭のメンバー決まりました！\nまりかも出演します！\n楽しみっっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/30/0861319/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「う」"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/30/0861319/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レッスン続きでハード。\n4thに向けてみんなで頑張ってます！\n楽しみだなー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/30/0861319/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*****HaPPy BirThDAy*****"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せっちゃん♡2012.10.29"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最初の頃バレエの話\nばっかりしてたなー..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クールビューティーで\n服かっこよくてダンスかっこよいのに\n「あはっ♪」っていう笑い方とか\nちょっと天然なところとか、\nかわいいの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/30/0861319/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/30/0861319/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せっちゃん変な子♪笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おめでとう！だいすき"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/30/0861319/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/30/0861319/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"抱き枕ないと眠れないタイプ？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/30/0861319/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大きいワニちゃんと\n仲良くねんねしてます←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/30/0861319/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何のパスタが好きなの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/30/0861319/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジェノベーゼ！\nトマトソースとかゴルゴンゾーラとか\nレモンクリームとか...和風のとか\nんー全部すきっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/30/0861319/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/30/0861319/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかとさゆにゃんがラーメン\n食べ行ったら、どっちが食べ終わる\nの早いと思う？？ 笑"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/30/0861319/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すすれないけど、食べる早さは\n確実に私のが早いって笑！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前さゆにゃんがたい焼き\n食べてたんだけどあまりにちまちま\n食べるから無理やりガブっと..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/30/0861319/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしたら怒られちゃったー笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/30/0861319/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんな手帳を使っていますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/30/0861319/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手帳持ってけど、\nマメに書かないからほとんど\n使ってない"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/30/0861319/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー...シンプルなの使ってるよー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/30/0861319/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までどんなコスプレ\nしたことある？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/30/0861319/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えーっと、バレリーナでしょ。\nツィギーでしょ、白熊でしょ、、\n↑これに関しては2ndの\n個人pv見てください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/30/0861319/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーとのごはん、\n誘う派?誘われる派?"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/30/0861319/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誘うし、誘われるし...流れで\n行こうぜーいえーい\nみたいな感じだよ笑\n本当、仲良いよねぇ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/30/0861319/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近はまってるもの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ホット豆乳！\n安定の豆乳です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/30/0861319/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きなこ黒ごまココア\nシナモンジンジャー...\n適当に混ぜてチンして夜飲んでる。\nホッとするよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......\n乃木ここの感想\nありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"浪漫の朗読してから\nナレーションも楽しくなりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鼻声だったのは...ばれてないねうん←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうそう！あのお弁当！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/30/0861319/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑あのお弁当"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会で疑わられたけど"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/30/0861319/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝早く起きて頑張ったんだよー\n信じてよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/30/0861319/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ママも手伝ってないよー\n真ん中のパスタはママが作ったけどー\nそれ以外は自分だよー←ぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キッシュはずっと作って\nみたかったんだ！\nラップに包まれた物体は\n栗きんとん。これも手作り。\nちょっと焦げたピーマンとナスも\n味は問題なかったし..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆったんのは弁当じゃなかったな笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり私は\nやればできる子なんだな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/30/0861319/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/30/0861319/0017.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日がんばろー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、おやすみなさい☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}